# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# yardmaster board — maintainer tooling, not part of this project.
#
# The board is how I drive agents against this repo; it is not something a
# contributor needs or a published package should carry. Live ticket state also
# changes on every claim, so committing it would bury the real history anyway.
# Backups live outside the repo entirely, under ~/.local/state/yardmaster/<project>/.
# The loops are the yardmaster plugin's skills (/ym-implement, /ym-review);
# this repo's conventions for them live in .board/PROJECT.md.
#
# NOTE: .claude/release-board.html is ALREADY TRACKED (baa6024) — a dead export
# of the retired hosted board. Untrack with `git rm --cached` when convenient;
# it stays in history either way, as RELEASE-PIPELINE.md does.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.board/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/release-board.html
.claude/BOARD.md
.claude/RUNBOOK.md
.claude/RUNBOOK.html
.claude/MIGRATION.md
